# SHA-256 checksums for third-party scanner binaries downloaded at run
# time (gitleaks, trivy, ...). One line per release: "<digest>  <filename>"
# (sha256sum format). A mismatch means the binary is not used.
#
# Before adding an entry, verify the tarball against its own project's
# published checksum/signature. Precede each entry with a comment linking
# to where it was downloaded from, so the digest is traceable back to its
# source. Remove entries no longer referenced.

# Original source: https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks/releases/download/v8.30.1/gitleaks_8.30.1_linux_x64.tar.gz
